{
  "id": "ch2_swing",
  "entry": "rescue_entry",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "rescue_entry",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "ch2_checkpoint_save",
          "checkpoint": "rescue"
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "别碰线。碰了会——"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "嗯？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "challenge"
    },
    {
      "id": "challenge",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "say",
          "slide": "out"
        },
        {
          "do": "rescue",
          "flag": "ch2/rescue_success"
        }
      ],
      "next": "failed",
      "next_when": {
        "if": {
          "var": "ch2/rescue_success",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true
        },
        "next": "rescued"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "failed",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "music",
          "path": "res://audio/bgm/ending_04_arrogant.wav"
        },
        {
          "do": "image",
          "path": "res://art/cg/ch2_rescue_injury.png",
          "fade": 0.3,
          "fill": true,
          "hide": false
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "啊—！！怎么..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "fade",
          "to": "black",
          "time": 0.45
        },
        {
          "do": "image_hide",
          "fade": 0.3
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "？？？",
              "text": "这种程度就不行了吗？呵，是我走眼了__"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "caption",
          "fade": 0.9,
          "wait_click": true,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "end 4 自以为是的到来",
              "size": 16
            },
            {
              "text": "你是主角没错，但主角可以换人啊",
              "size": 14
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "retry",
          "label": "重试救援",
          "next": "retry"
        },
        {
          "id": "finish",
          "label": "返回标题",
          "next": "ending"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "retry",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "say",
          "slide": "out"
        },
        {
          "do": "ch2_checkpoint_restore",
          "checkpoint": "rescue"
        },
        {
          "do": "fade",
          "to": "clear",
          "time": 0.3
        }
      ],
      "next": "challenge"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "ending": "end4_arrogant",
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "ch2_checkpoint_clear",
          "checkpoint": "rescue"
        },
        {
          "do": "music",
          "path": "res://audio/bgm/ending_04_arrogant.wav"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rescued",
      "set": {
        "ch2/rescued_c": true
      },
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "ch2_checkpoint_clear",
          "checkpoint": "rescue"
        },
        {
          "do": "npc_pose",
          "id": "c",
          "pose": "down"
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": ".....你竟然能直接引导因果线？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "等下，你又是谁！？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "你妈妈没有跟你说，问别人前先要自·报·家·门吗？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "这样子啊~ 在下白凝冰，白塔分部下的一名专案员。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "现在可以了吗，小姐"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "{name}，自己经营一家事务所"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "还有，你说的因果线...是什么？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "这地方的规则。蚀界里的所有东西都靠‘if - then’运转。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "你碰了线，按理说会被标记成入侵者。但你没有。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "你不是能力者，对吧？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "什么能力者？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "欸，那你是怎么进来的"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "呐，这个吊坠，是有人告诉我可以进来这里的"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "！？ 竟然是..."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "那你其实不该在这的。这地方叫蚀界。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "执念太强的人，脑子里那些‘if’会漏出来，把现实泡烂。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "你们知道的白塔，就那个你们知道的行政机构，其实也管这个。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "白塔！？专案局还管这些吗"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "或许只是你们眼里的呢，白塔的本质还是维持世界秩序的稳定，看到的面不同罢了"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "白塔算是官方组织，还有一些工会。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "破解蚀界的话就能得到相应结晶，结晶含有巨大能量，很多人也是奔着这个来的"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "就是那个夜幕之泪！？那人还说什么很·简·单"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "我现在倒是很好奇，是什么原因让你敢进入这里"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "....."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "我...我其实就是来找个猫"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "猫？ 如果我没想错的话，那只猫不是普通猫"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "它已经在这地方待太久了，已经和蚀界长在一起了"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "你越晚找到它，它就越不像猫，到最后它会"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "会怎样？"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "会变成这地方的一部分。到时候你找到的就彻底不是猫，是一团‘if’。"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "算了算了，遇见就是缘分。{name}，和我组队吧"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "在这个地方，有个伴还是会好一点"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "agree",
          "label": "同意组队",
          "next": "join_c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "join_c",
      "set": {
        "ch2/teamed_c": true
      },
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "npc_talk",
          "id": "c",
          "talk": "ch2_c_wait"
        },
        {
          "do": "say",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "白凝冰",
              "portrait": "c/neutral",
              "side": "right",
              "text": "这个给你，只要你拿着它，后面你遇到困难，我都会来英·雄·救·美的呢 ^ ^"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "我",
              "portrait": "protagonist/quiet",
              "side": "left",
              "text": "...不需要"
            },
            {
              "text": "一道闪光划过，落在了你的手里"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "grant_coin"
    },
    {
      "id": "grant_coin",
      "set": {
        "item/charm": 1
      },
      "stage": [
        {
          "do": "focus"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
